    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40016" root="نطر" body-key="n">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَطَرَ</span></b> , (IKtt, Msb,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَطُرَ</span></b> , (TA,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَطْرٌ</span>

(IKtt, Msb, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نِطَارَةٌ</span>, (Sgh, K,) <i>He kept,</i>
or <i>watched, vines,</i> (IKtt, Msb, K,) and <i>palmtrees,</i> (K,) and <i>seed-produce.</i> (TA.) See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَطْرَةٌ</span>
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاطُورٌ</span>.

